    },
    "reading": "the gain grows monotonically as the threshold loosens, so the annotation improves the ranking broadly rather than only the extreme tail. A tail-only effect would have shrunk toward the median, not grown.",
    "why_it_matters": "this distinguishes 'finds the few best pairs' from 'orders the whole list better', and the data say the latter"
  },
